    "text": "During an incident response engagement at a multinational e-commerce company headquartered in Germany, an security investigator discovers that an unauthorized third party exfiltrated a database containing full names, hashed passwords, and email addresses of European Union citizens. Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), what is the maximum timeframe within which the organization must notify the competent supervisory authority after becoming aware of the breach?",
