    "text": "A security analyst is conducting offline password cracking against an exfiltrated NTLM hash dump. The analyst attempts to use precomputed lookup tables containing millions of pre-rendered cryptographic hash values corresponding to plaintext passphrases. However, the attack fails because the target system appended a unique random salt value to every user password before hashing. Which password attack vector was rendered ineffective by the salt?",
