    "chapterIndex": 0,
    "text": "During an active scanning phase, an ethical hacker initiates a socket connection to target host `192.168.1.10` on port 21 using Netcat: `nc -vv 192.168.1.10 21`. The system responds with: `220 (vsFTPd 2.3.4)`. What precise technique has been executed, and what key intelligence was acquired?",
