    "text": "A forensic analyst investigates a suspected exfiltration channel. The analyst executes a statistical Chi-square analysis against a collection of high-resolution `.jpg` images downloaded from a public company blog. The analysis detects unexpected, uniform randomness in the least significant bit patterns of the pixel matrices across several files. Which anti-forensics investigation technique is the analyst using to detect hidden data?",
