    "text": "During passive email footprinting, an analyst examines the full internet header of a spear-phishing email received by an executive. The header reveals the following entry:\n`Received: from mail.attacker-domain.com (198.51.100.25) by mx.targetcorp.com with ESMTP id k81Jsl...` \nWhat crucial information does the bottom-most `Received:` header line typically expose to the analyst?",
