    "text": "During a post-exploitation phase on a Windows domain server, an adversary attaches a debugger to the running process `lsass.exe` and injects dynamic code to hook the `LsaApCallPackage` API function. This allows the adversary to capture plaintext credentials whenever user accounts authenticate to the system. Which category of threat mechanism is being deployed?",
