    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-00-063",
    "chapterIndex": 0,
    "text": "An adversary on a local Wi-Fi network transmits unsolicited ARP Reply packets to a victim workstation and the default network gateway. The forged packets claim that the gateway's IP address maps directly to the adversary's wireless MAC address. What attack is being executed, and what primary capability does it grant the adversary?",
