    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-00-099",
    "chapterIndex": 0,
    "text": "A web application endpoint accepts file paths via an HTTP parameter: `https://example.com/download?file=invoice.pdf`. A tester modifies the parameter value to `https://example.com/download?file=../../../../etc/passwd` and retrieves sensitive system user details. Which vulnerability was demonstrated?",
