    "text": "An ethical hacker performs traceroute mapping against target server 203.0.113.50. The resulting hop output displays consecutive asterisks (`* * *`) starting at hop 7 through hop 12, after which hop 13 responds with the destination server IP. What does this output indicate regarding network security controls along the path?",
