    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-003-079",
    "chapterIndex": 2,
    "text": "A tester sends empty UDP datagrams to a range of ports on a Linux server and receives ICMP port-unreachable messages for most ports, but silence for ports 53 and 161. What is the correct interpretation?",
