    "text": "A security analyst is reviewing a Qualys report that lists a critical vulnerability on a public-facing web server. The CVSS temporal score is lower than the base score because a public exploit is not yet available and a vendor patch has been released. Which CVSS metric group is primarily responsible for this reduction?",
