    "text": "An analyst is reviewing logs from an anti-ARP spoofing tool and sees an alert indicating that the MAC address mapped to the default gateway's IP address (10.0.0.1) has changed from 00:11:22:33:44:55 to AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF in the local ARP cache. However, the legitimate gateway's MAC address is still 00:11:22:33:44:55. What is the most accurate conclusion?",
