    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-008-022",
    "chapterIndex": 7,
    "text": "A security team deploys an open-source tool on a Linux server connected to a mirrored switch port to monitor Ethernet and IP address pairings. The tool sends an alert when it detects a MAC address changing its associated IP address more than a configured threshold of times in a short period. Which tool is being described?",
