    "text": "During an internal penetration test, an ethical hacker uses a tool that automates the process of ARP cache poisoning to intercept plaintext credentials from an internal web application. The tool automatically forwards the intercepted traffic between the victim and the gateway to avoid breaking the connection. Which tool is most likely being used?",
