    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-008-025",
    "chapterIndex": 7,
    "text": "To prevent a rogue DHCP server from assigning malicious IP configurations to clients, a network administrator implements a security feature on the switch that builds a table of trusted DHCP servers and blocks untrusted DHCP messages from access ports. Which countermeasure is being implemented?",
