    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-008-032",
    "chapterIndex": 7,
    "text": "An attacker has successfully established a Man-in-the-Middle position using ARP spoofing. They wait for a victim to query `update.example.com` via DNS and forge a DNS response pointing to a malicious IP. To ensure the victim accepts the forged response, what timing requirement must the attacker meet?",
