    "text": "A penetration tester has successfully established a Man-in-the-Middle position between a client and a server using ARP spoofing. The tester observes an unencrypted DNS query for `internal-payroll.local`. The tester immediately forges a DNS response pointing to a malicious IP before the legitimate DNS server can reply. Which associated attack is this?",
