    "text": "In a virtualized cloud environment, a Virtual Machine (VM) is live-migrated from Hypervisor A to Hypervisor B without any downtime. After the migration, other VMs on the same subnet can still communicate with the migrated VM seamlessly. What protocol mechanism automatically updated the network switches' ARP caches to reflect the new physical location?",
