    "text": "A penetration tester uses a tool to broadcast thousands of fake DHCP DISCOVER messages with spoofed MAC addresses. After a few seconds, legitimate users on the subnet begin reporting that their machines have IP addresses in the 169.254.0.0/16 range and cannot access the internet. What is the technical term for the IP range assigned to the users?",
