    "text": "A network administrator has enabled DHCP Snooping, Dynamic ARP Inspection (DAI), and IP Source Guard on a access switch. A critical server with a statically configured IP address (not obtained via DHCP) is moved to this switch. The server can successfully send traffic, but all inbound traffic from the network is dropped by the switch. What is the most likely cause?",
