    "text": "A host-based intrusion detection system (HIDS) alerts a user that it has detected an ARP spoofing attempt. The HIDS log indicates that it received an ARP reply where the Ethernet source MAC address does not match the sender MAC address inside the ARP payload. Why is this a strong indicator of an ARP spoofing attack?",
