    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-008-080",
    "chapterIndex": 7,
    "text": "A security analyst suspects a covert channel is being used to exfiltrate data via ICMP packets. The analyst knows that legitimate ping packets on this network are exactly 64 bytes, but the exfiltration packets are much larger (e.g., 1024 bytes). Which tcpdump command will only capture ICMP packets larger than 500 bytes?",
