    "text": "The CEO of a publicly traded company receives a highly personalized email referencing his recent conference keynote, his golf club membership, and a fabricated legal subpoena requiring immediate action via a malicious link. Security analysts note the campaign only targeted five C-suite executives across the industry. What is this attack most accurately classified as?",
