    "text": "During a red team engagement, an operator calls the IT helpdesk impersonating a traveling sales executive who claims to be locked out of his account before an important client presentation. The operator uses urgency and mild frustration to pressure the technician into resetting the password without following standard identity verification steps. This is an example of which technique?",
