    "text": "A marketing employee receives a LinkedIn message from a 'recruiter' at a competing firm offering a lucrative role, and is asked to complete a 'skills assessment' by downloading and running an executable file. The employee runs it on their corporate-issued laptop. Which combination of techniques is being leveraged in this attack chain?",
