    "chapterIndex": 8,
    "text": "A security team wants to specifically reduce the success rate of business email compromise (BEC) attacks that spoof the CEO's exact email address (not a lookalike domain) after determining that MFA and awareness training were already in place but insufficient. Which additional technical control would MOST directly address this specific spoofing gap?",
