    "chapterIndex": 8,
    "text": "A CISO is designing controls specifically to counter AI-generated hyper-personalized phishing lures that scrape social media, public records, and breached data to craft messages tailored to each individual employee's interests and recent activities. Which countermeasure is MOST specifically tailored to this evolving threat beyond standard generic phishing defenses?",
