    "text": "A CISO is briefing the board on why last quarter's incident (an HR employee onboarding a fraudulent 'remote contractor' whose identity documents were entirely AI-generated deepfake images passing initial visual review) slipped past existing controls. Which statement best explains the underlying gap in relying on visual document review alone against AI-generated identity fraud?",
