    "text": "An attacker obtains a valid JWT that was issued to a legitimate user. The token contains the claim \"role\": \"user\" and is signed with a weak HS256 secret that the attacker has cracked. The attacker modifies the claim to \"role\": \"admin\", re-signs the token, and presents it to the API. Which class of attack has occurred?",
