    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-011-012",
    "chapterIndex": 10,
    "text": "An organization has implemented secure cookie flags (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax) and short session timeouts. Nevertheless, an attacker who has already compromised a user’s endpoint continues to operate inside the victim’s authenticated session by periodically sending keep-alive requests. Which residual risk remains?",
