    "text": "A security consultant is demonstrating the difference between stealing credentials and taking over an already-authenticated session. In the first case the attacker obtains a username and password and logs in as the victim. In the second case the attacker never obtains the password but continues an existing browser session. Which pair correctly labels these two activities?",
