    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-011-018",
    "chapterIndex": 10,
    "text": "A development team is implementing a new SPA that uses JWT for API authentication. The security architect insists that the tokens must be bound to the client’s TLS channel or to a cryptographic proof of possession. Which defensive concept is being mandated?",
