    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-011-020",
    "chapterIndex": 10,
    "text": "A blue-team member is writing detection rules for session hijacking. Which of the following observed behaviors is the strongest indicator that an active session has been hijacked rather than that credentials were simply stolen and used for a new login?",
