    "text": "During an internal audit, the team discovers that session cookies are marked Secure and HttpOnly, yet the application still accepts the same session ID when it is supplied in a URL query parameter. An attacker who obtains the ID through a referrer header or browser history can therefore hijack the session. Which additional control is required?",
