    "chapterIndex": 13,
    "text": "While testing a multi-tenant SaaS application, a tester authenticates as a user in Tenant A and then changes a 'tenant_id' parameter to the identifier of Tenant B. The application returns Tenant B’s data without additional authorization checks. Which vulnerability is present?",
