    "text": "A penetration tester needs to extract the version of a SQL Server instance behind a strict WAF that blocks the string “@@version”. The tester successfully retrieves the information by converting the query into a series of CHAR() function calls that reconstruct the required system variable. Which evasion technique is illustrated?",
