    "chapterIndex": 14,
    "text": "While assessing a customer-review portal, an ethical hacker notices that a malicious payload placed in the “review text” field is later executed when a moderator opens the moderation queue and the application constructs a different SQL query using that stored review. What class of SQL injection vulnerability has been identified?",
