    "text": "A penetration tester is engaged by a mid-sized manufacturing firm that still operates several legacy warehouse access points configured with WEP. During the engagement the tester observes that the access points generate only a few hundred unique IVs per hour under normal traffic. Which technique should the tester employ to accelerate IV collection sufficiently for a successful statistical attack within the allotted assessment window?",
