    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-019-001",
    "chapterIndex": 18,
    "text": "A DevOps team at a fintech company deploys a microservices application on Kubernetes. During a penetration test, the ethical hacker discovers that several pods are running with the privileged security context enabled and the hostPath volume mounted to /var/run/docker.sock. Which attack technique is most likely to succeed first against this misconfiguration?",
