    "text": "An organization uses AWS Lambda functions triggered by S3 ObjectCreated events to process customer documents. A security assessment reveals that the Lambda execution role has s3:GetObject and s3:PutObject permissions on the entire bucket, and the function code does not validate the object key or content type. Which serverless-specific attack is the most immediate risk?",
