    "text": "During a red-team engagement against a Kubernetes cluster, the tester obtains a service-account token from a compromised pod. The token has the system:authenticated group and the clusterrolebinding grants get/list/watch on secrets in all namespaces. What is the most effective next step to escalate privileges?",
