    "text": "A company runs critical business logic as Azure Functions triggered by Event Grid and Service Bus. The functions use a managed identity that has Contributor rights on the entire resource group. An attacker who can publish messages to the Service Bus discovers that the function code deserializes the message body without validation. Which attack path poses the highest risk?",
