    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-020-024",
    "chapterIndex": 19,
    "text": "A digital forensics team investigating a data breach at a software vendor determines that the attacker did not break the encryption algorithm mathematically. Instead, the attacker recorded electromagnetic emissions from a nearby workstation performing cryptographic signing operations over several hours and used signal processing techniques to correlate emission patterns with specific private key bits being processed. Which category of cryptographic attack was used?",
