    "id": "CEH-V13-CQ-020-038",
    "chapterIndex": 19,
    "text": "A security team implements Certificate Transparency monitoring for their primary domain after a previous incident. Six months later, their monitoring system alerts them to a certificate issued by a CA they have never used, for a subdomain they did not request. The team is able to detect and revoke this fraudulent certificate within hours, preventing any customer impact. Which PKI security control functioned as intended in this scenario?",
