    "text": "A threat intel analyst obtains a leaked archive of ransomware negotiation chat logs alongside the corresponding encrypted command-and-control traffic captured during the same incident window, allowing correlation between specific known plaintext messages and their encrypted transmission counterparts. The analyst had no ability to interact with or influence the malware's encryption routine directly. Which cryptanalytic attack model best describes the analyst's position?",
