    "text": "A domain registrar's security team is reviewing a client's DNS configuration and notices no CAA (Certification Authority Authorization) records exist for a high-value domain used in wire transfer confirmations. The team explains to the client that this absence creates a specific, exploitable gap. Which statement most accurately describes the risk introduced by the missing CAA records?",
